---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | FARID MAHMOUDI" 
  description="Terms of Service and Agreement guidelines for Farid Mahmoudi's web engineering services."
>
  <main class="min-h-screen py-16 px-6 sm:px-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-sans">
    
    {/* Capsule Back Button */}
    <div class="mb-12">
      <a 
        href="/" 
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-white/5 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 hover:text-neutral-950 dark:hover:text-white hover:border-neutral-300 dark:hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm"
      >
        <span>Back to Home</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    {/* Document Header */}
    <div class="mb-12 border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 font-normal">
        Last updated: August 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Plain Readable Document Body */}
    <div class="space-y-10 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base font-light">
      
      {/* Section 1 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          1. Acceptance of Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using this website, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please refrain from using the platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 2 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          2. Engineering & Development Services
        </h2>
        <p>
          Farid Mahmoudi provides custom full-stack web development, workflow automation, CMS architecture, and AI integration services. All client engagements are governed by individual project agreements, statements of work, and technical deliverables defined prior to project commencement.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 3 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          3. Intellectual Property Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          The original content, design system, source code, logos, and branding elements on this portfolio website are the exclusive intellectual property of Farid Mahmoudi.
        </p>
        <p>
          For custom client software projects, full ownership and intellectual property rights for bespoke codebase deliverables transfer to the client upon receipt of final payment, as specified in individual client contracts.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 4 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          4. Acceptable Use
        </h2>
        <p>
          You agree to use this website and its interactive tools (such as contact forms and playground applications) strictly for lawful purposes. You must not engage in automated spamming, unauthorized vulnerability scanning, or any activity that disrupts site performance or security.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 5 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          5. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          This website and its demonstration tools are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind. Farid Mahmoudi shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from site usage or temporary service unavailability.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 6 */}
      <section class="space-y-2 border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          6. Contact Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions regarding these Terms of Service, please reach out via the <a href="/contact" class="text-neutral-900 dark:text-white font-medium underline underline-offset-4">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
